WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.494
Connect your browser to Vydrop in a few simple steps.

2
00:00:04.494 --> 00:00:08.453
Follow the section for Chrome, Edge, or Firefox.

3
00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:15.530
Download the official Windows ZIP and extract the whole package into a permanent folder.

4
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.624
Open Vydrop dot exe. Keep the Browser folder beside it.

5
00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:27.062
In Vydrop, open Settings, then Browser integration.

6
00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:30.506
Choose the browser where you want to use the extension.

7
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.417
Select Set up for your chosen browser.

8
00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:41.786
Vydrop connects the app, copies the correct path, and opens the browser setup page.

9
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.029
In Chrome, turn on Developer mode and choose Load unpacked.

10
00:00:48.029 --> 00:00:54.172
If the page did not open, enter chrome colon slash slash extensions in the address bar.

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.643
Paste the copied path into the folder picker's address bar and press Enter.

12
00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:05.677
Select the chromium folder inside Browser, then choose Select Folder.

13
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:14.323
Keep the Vydrop extension enabled. In Details, allow access to the websites you use.

14
00:01:14.323 --> 00:01:17.392
You can also pin it to the browser toolbar.

15
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:25.883
For Edge, choose Set up Edge in Vydrop, then turn on Developer mode and choose Load unpacked.

16
00:01:25.883 --> 00:01:29.437
Select the same Browser slash chromium folder.

17
00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:38.260
For Firefox, choose Set up Firefox in Vydrop, then Load Temporary Add-on in the browser.

18
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:43.589
Select manifest dot json inside Browser, then firefox.

19
00:01:43.589 --> 00:01:49.817
This installation is temporary. Load the add-on again after restarting Firefox.

20
00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:55.492
Refresh the video page and start playing a public video.

21
00:01:55.492 --> 00:02:00.386
Click Download by Vydrop, or use the extension's toolbar button.

22
00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:06.099
With the connection enabled, the extension can launch Vydrop even when the app is closed.

23
00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:14.838
Wait for Vydrop to check the video, then choose video or audio, quality, and a save folder.

24
00:02:14.838 --> 00:02:20.982
Choose Download when you are ready. Sending the link does not start saving automatically.

25
00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:27.659
If the button is missing, refresh the page and check website access.

26
00:02:27.659 --> 00:02:34.297
If you move Vydrop, run browser setup again. The illustrated guide has more help.
